{"version":2,"exportedAt":1767876844253,"story":{"title":"Flik the Brave Dragon","userPrompt":"A brave little dragon","authorStyleId":"dr-seuss","readingLevel":"emerging","illustrationStyleId":"cartoon_comic","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Flik was a dragon, so small and so green!\nHe lived in a cave, the best you have seen!\nHe wished he could roar, a big, loud BUMP!","illustrationPrompt":"Flik, a tiny green dragon with big, curious eyes, peeks out of a cozy cave entrance. The cave is decorated with colorful flowers and glowing stones. He looks slightly worried. Bright, warm colors. Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1767876773368,"durationMs":4883,"retries":0,"promptLength":632,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A tiny emerald green scales with a lighter lime green belly dragon, big-expressive warm honey brown eyes with sad expression, with small woven leaf necklace, small, rounded horns that are a lighter shade of green, large, floppy ears, a small, perpetually worried frown, tiny, almost translucent wings, chubby build. Flik, a small green dragon, standing inside his cave looking sad, trying to roar but only a squeak comes out. in Inside Flik's cave. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"But all that came out was a squeaky 'Squeak-Hump!'\nThe big dragons laughed, 'He’s too teeny, it’s true!'\nPoor Flik felt so sad, 'What am I to do?'","illustrationPrompt":"Several large, imposing dragons are laughing at Flik. They are different colors like orange, purple, and blue. Flik looks down at the ground, sad. The background is a rocky mountainside. Use muted colors for the big dragons and keep Flik bright. Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1767876821701,"